# ---> Go
# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

/t
*.bak

# Keystone Core specific
build/
dist/
docvalidation
scripts/docvalidation/docvalidation
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
keystone-core.yaml
kscore-agent.yaml
*.creds
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
.DS_Store
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
coverage.out
.idea

# Rust build artifacts
**/target/
Cargo.lock
!modules/sdk/rust/Cargo.lock

# C++ build artifacts
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile.cmake
**/*.cmake
!**/CMakeLists.txt

# WASM build artifacts
*.wasm
*.wat

# Hugo documentation
docs/.hugo_build.lock
docs/node_modules
docs/package-lock.json
docs/resources

# E2E test reports
test/e2e/performance/reports/
/.python-version

# Claude Code / AI session artifacts
CHECKPOINT.md
.claude-session-notes.md
.claude/
SESSION-SUMMARY*.md
*_TEST_RESULTS.md
*_SESSION*.md
.claude-session-context.md
tools/moddoc/moddoc
